## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database Package (`packages/database`)

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///c:/Users/rawat/BUIMB%20Projects/Bahi/packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Change `provider = "postgresql"` to `provider = "mongodb"`.
- Update all model primary keys from `id String @id @default(cuid())` to `id String @id @default(auto()) @map("_id") @db.ObjectId`.
- Update all relational foreign keys (`tenantId`, `userId`, `roleId`, `contactId`, `productId`, `warehouseId`, `stageId`, `quotationId`, etc.) to `String @db.ObjectId` (or `String? @db.ObjectId`).
- Convert all `Decimal @db.Decimal(...)` fields across models (`Opportunity`, `Product`, `Quotation`, `QuotationLine`, `SalesOrder`, `SalesOrderLine`, `StockMove`, `Invoice`, `Payment`, `Employee`, `Timesheet`) to `Float`.

#### [MODIFY] [package.json](file:///c:/Users/rawat/BUIMB%20Projects/Bahi/packages/database/package.json)
- Update `"migrate"` script from `prisma migrate dev` to `prisma db push`.
- Update `"migrate:deploy"` to `prisma db push --accept-data-loss`.

#### [MODIFY] [seed.ts](file:///c:/Users/rawat/BUIMB%20Projects/Bahi/packages/database/prisma/seed.ts)
- Ensure all created and upserted records conform to the MongoDB schema.

### 2. Root Project & Infrastructure

#### [MODIFY] [package.json](file:///c:/Users/rawat/BUIMB%20Projects/Bahi/package.json)
- Update root script `"db:migrate"` to trigger `prisma db push`.

#### [MODIFY] [docker-compose.yml](file:///c:/Users/rawat/BUIMB%20Projects/Bahi/docker-compose.yml)
- Replace the PostgreSQL service with a MongoDB service (`mongo:7.0`) configured with `--replSet rs0` and port `27017:27017`.

#### [MODIFY] [.env.example](file:///c:/Users/rawat/BUIMB%20Projects/Bahi/.env.example)
- Update `DATABASE_URL` format to MongoDB:
  - Local: `DATABASE_URL="mongodb://localhost:27017/bahi_dev?replicaSet=rs0"`
  - Atlas: `DATABASE_URL="mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/bahi_dev?retryWrites=true&w=majority"`

### 3. API Service (`backend`)

#### [MODIFY] [prisma.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/rawat/BUIMB%20Projects/Bahi/backend/src/modules/core/prisma/prisma.service.ts)
- Update startup log message from `Ensure PostgreSQL is running` to `Ensure MongoDB is running`.

