## Verification Plan

### 1. Schema Validation & Client Generation
- Run `node node_modules/prisma/build/index.js validate` on `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma`.
- Run `npm run db:generate` to regenerate `@prisma/client`.

### 2. Build Verification
- Run `npm run build` across all workspaces to ensure frontend and backend compile with zero TypeScript errors.

### 3. Runtime Verification
- Start the web UI with `npm run dev --workspace=frontend` and verify `http://localhost:3000`.
- Start the API with `npm run dev --workspace=backend` and verify `http://localhost:4000/api/docs`.
